WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.060
Number 9 - your emotional well-being. How do

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.120
you handle what you feel? Can you recognise your

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.340
emotions? Can you process them? Can you label

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:11.680
them? Or do you tend to block them, escape and

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:14.020
push them down? Be honest, there's no shame

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.240
here and the more that you connect is the better the

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.520
result that you like to get.

